  "scope": "Previously published 119 mutually assigned counters. CRCs validate received packets. Coordinates for partial DUs rely on the original receiver assignments. The digest at each site concatenates four-byte big-endian counter then the 96 observed bytes, in ascending counter order. One EVS word spans 20 ms, one phase DU spans 400 ms, and its three-phase group spans 1.2 s. Successive blocks can differ without every octet changing or their components being refreshed simultaneously."
